      "id": "clerk-review-note",
      "title": "Maren's Chalk Stair Docket Review Note",
      "kind": "fictional first-person note",
      "reliability_note": "Newly authored fictional note; the clerk reports a first-passage docket review after the lapse record: the entry remains open, no new filings have been lodged, and the clerk makes no finding and resolves nothing. Both accounts stand unresolved; the note is not evidence of testimony truth, an authenticated chronology, a breach finding, a continuing duty, a winner between the accounts, or an external historical fact."
    }
  ],
